  "description": "With rapid developments to the human civilization, the need for God and his angels have decreased at a significant rate. Thus, the angels are experiencing a historic unemployment crisis! With this problem in hand, God decides to start a company that will reduce the unemployment rate in both Heaven and Hell. He hereby founds the company, H&H Roman Company! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes a prologue and five side story chapters.*",
